{
  "_readme": [
    "SAMPLE HOTEL DATA — NOTHING IN HERE IS REAL.",
    "",
    "Every property, price, rating and review count below is invented. No hotel",
    "has quoted these rates, none of them can be booked, and the names are not",
    "real businesses — they are constructed from a street or district plus a",
    "generic suffix so they cannot be mistaken for a trading property.",
    "",
    "This exists so the hotel search, results, filters, sorting, pagination and",
    "detail pages can be built and demonstrated before a supplier key is added.",
    "It is off in production unless HOTEL_SAMPLE_DATA=1 is set explicitly, and",
    "everything it produces is tagged source:'sample' so the UI must say so.",
    "See src/lib/providers/sample-hotels.ts.",
    "",
    "Photographs are local files from public/images. They are stock images of",
    "buildings and places, deliberately repeated across entries rather than",
    "matched to a property, because pairing an invented hotel with a real",
    "building's photograph would be the one genuinely misleading thing here."
  ],
